{
  "format": 1,
  "id": "id/bipa7.u01",
  "language": "id",
  "unit": "bipa7.u01",
  "version": 1,
  "content_hash": "5ffb3bac1ca24382fd9c2f376a2808aa523b65898517a54ce68ad9a26493e74a",
  "lessons": [
    {
      "id": "bipa7.u01.l01",
      "sha256": "b24e3a63ea632282db86346ff18908c5496a2e01a68217eae1e57b154b103a05"
    },
    {
      "id": "bipa7.u01.l02",
      "sha256": "95af44f3ea81a30931efc7fd0387e5db2a2711837253fa37b54fbd2ce11368c8"
    },
    {
      "id": "bipa7.u01.l03",
      "sha256": "470d9c36782dd6f5eaf3c0de09b0748e7bf58340f65f72cb8e505fd89f6399df"
    },
    {
      "id": "bipa7.u01.l04",
      "sha256": "fd75f800acfc2b6d7491cece2b2625aec68882eef17041310f055dc9851c8800"
    },
    {
      "id": "bipa7.u01.l05",
      "sha256": "bc70dbbd9c6e18ba283616cb1819a756f4cb53544a0021fc8ad5bfbc1bd7c4cd"
    },
    {
      "id": "bipa7.u01.l06",
      "sha256": "eb4735f5fb811382b9727c992dc7ec9baedf280b61a782650a26de7f0a143d1b"
    }
  ],
  "audio": [
    {
      "key": "01edb727533b8165e4b5175b5c992ecdb8f77a8365d09efdc67e4c4c3d23f4ff",
      "text": "medali",
      "voice": "id_gadis",
      "chars": 6,
      "mime": "audio/mpeg"
    },
    {
      "key": "02e0fba8b56951631a200d5770a3c87ce45c0d83cdef25ffcaacef56d14ccec8",
      "text": "kabar terkini",
      "voice": "id_gadis",
      "chars": 13,
      "mime": "audio/mpeg"
    },
    {
      "key": "085f09769e0a34a4d6e2ef584c8d8a14708eb283e505b324cec8349aa6cc7959",
      "text": "pendengar",
      "voice": "id_gadis",
      "chars": 9,
      "mime": "audio/mpeg"
    },
    {
      "key": "0a4ed8d95463d8cec466eb9a842bad51c0a4f00a1b2251c23b051d0d3305291e",
      "text": "Hampir. Di judul, pakai \"Raih\", bukan \"meraih\". Lebih pendek dan kuat.",
      "voice": "id_gadis",
      "chars": 70,
      "mime": "audio/mpeg"
    },
    {
      "key": "0c6101ff35946d13db778cdd111bae5f10d7c1f6495c4bb6bef31cca1d33c3fb",
      "text": "Ini liputan khusus dari Sorong tentang lomba tari remaja.",
      "voice": "id_gadis",
      "chars": 57,
      "mime": "audio/mpeg"
    },
    {
      "key": "0ceaea5db53c7b730c1950f4603517af544e0d00398a605c0c013a3bfcfa1cc2",
      "text": "reporter",
      "voice": "id_gadis",
      "chars": 8,
      "mime": "audio/mpeg"
    },
    {
      "key": "11a2e178a734cbbe86f4165fdd72f4a218b7b0a4e55bcf2521ea8deed59319db",
      "text": "wirausaha",
      "voice": "id_gadis",
      "chars": 9,
      "mime": "audio/mpeg"
    },
    {
      "key": "13330103ae86989b3d0ba1c6f14f6c3ca8c5eb31fe8be451c4c00097b3bc8af9",
      "text": "Prestasi pelajar Sorong itu dilaporkan oleh banyak media.",
      "voice": "id_gadis",
      "chars": 57,
      "mime": "audio/mpeg"
    },
    {
      "key": "178c407b5deac8df45af89609c58374fad9de2f88a469ca657fee1fbc87942c2",
      "text": "Senang, tentu. Tetapi lebih senang lagi kalau ada wirausaha muda lain yang ikut mulai.",
      "voice": "id_gadis",
      "chars": 86,
      "mime": "audio/mpeg"
    },
    {
      "key": "21f7a448d4f2b1b6a9a40bf3677802eef0a20ce8aab5939553802baab936804a",
      "text": "Siap. \"Selamat malam, Pendengar. Inilah kabar terkini dari Sorong.\"",
      "voice": "id_ardi",
      "chars": 67,
      "mime": "audio/mpeg"
    },
    {
      "key": "2364650d5da799e4f13f2da065541b09fd11321fe2a323f89aaf0f5fa525b7af",
      "text": "Kongres itu dihadiri pemuda dari berbagai daerah.",
      "voice": "id_gadis",
      "chars": 49,
      "mime": "audio/mpeg"
    },
    {
      "key": "24fa5748f49d7d5ef31c47bb6f84b1ad73959c8ff8b2b4e65dc6814024b2d7cb",
      "text": "kancah",
      "voice": "id_gadis",
      "chars": 6,
      "mime": "audio/mpeg"
    },
    {
      "key": "2536bef8a2e0afca3c866e92482fd267e7eb791eaf630c61431281d40febb9d7",
      "text": "Penghargaan ini untuk dua puluh warga yang bekerja bersama saya.",
      "voice": "id_gadis",
      "chars": 64,
      "mime": "audio/mpeg"
    },
    {
      "key": "2549f59a5f4488fea7130391425bf36b1020a3268dc46a7c2100cd0956517f82",
      "text": "Kami putra dan putri Indonesia mengaku bertumpah darah yang satu, tanah air Indonesia.",
      "voice": "id_gadis",
      "chars": 86,
      "mime": "audio/mpeg"
    },
    {
      "key": "29c5a422450a4a5ad89eb5c9e753c00d7d5dc665dffcd05dcba4b8960c9c7165",
      "text": "tanah air",
      "voice": "id_gadis",
      "chars": 9,
      "mime": "audio/mpeg"
    },
    {
      "key": "2b86b5a5c1172d3b472c5701902bb21b766b0c00f2fb796ea4252ed80d599a74",
      "text": "berbangsa",
      "voice": "id_gadis",
      "chars": 9,
      "mime": "audio/mpeg"
    },
    {
      "key": "2bbfc0a89556be11a5fd59e754d15d46ff8f482c32c7ad5e1fb7ff79b11d21a4",
      "text": "Kebakaran di pasar itu diduga karena korsleting listrik.",
      "voice": "id_gadis",
      "chars": 56,
      "mime": "audio/mpeg"
    },
    {
      "key": "2c25bfad4bd0a16dc7ad9bddbe5413f87df8b27deff13957dc1f4263869cd2c0",
      "text": "Besok kamu naik kapal cepat ke Waisai, kan? Dua jam saja.",
      "voice": "id_gadis",
      "chars": 57,
      "mime": "audio/mpeg"
    },
    {
      "key": "3b81266e0944a7a1b5fdf405ddc2f5b3508ce0939b97e976eded9804415c7627",
      "text": "Maria, apa yang membuat Anda memulai usaha ini?",
      "voice": "id_ardi",
      "chars": 47,
      "mime": "audio/mpeg"
    },
    {
      "key": "3c73771b487c6c34bcbc14ca76f4c88b93e1ed8de896321bcf08d52bb8975211",
      "text": "Saya mulai dengan sejarah sanggar itu, sejak tahun 2010.",
      "voice": "id_ardi",
      "chars": 56,
      "mime": "audio/mpeg"
    },
    {
      "key": "3d9616ad803997fcced896f28ee1550d01386b7abb9981cd08be687e122ca2a3",
      "text": "prestasi",
      "voice": "id_gadis",
      "chars": 8,
      "mime": "audio/mpeg"
    },
    {
      "key": "400ea1f00d4c9fc40486ad0a54c9ba7359b9d0d06246c7b2496f7768215e7102",
      "text": "Bagus, tetapi pelan sedikit. Pendengar kita banyak yang mendengar sambil menyetir.",
      "voice": "id_gadis",
      "chars": 82,
      "mime": "audio/mpeg"
    },
    {
      "key": "40b8aa66d6093e502ddf2846c86e49d59243ed1a7854a8cf37675e6069a36d32",
      "text": "Kami mengaku berbangsa yang satu, bangsa Indonesia.",
      "voice": "id_gadis",
      "chars": 51,
      "mime": "audio/mpeg"
    },
    {
      "key": "449df1e4dfb3f64d52bba08d36f883d96ff420114fe511eff65aee713ddd05fc",
      "text": "Dua orang dilaporkan hilang setelah banjir.",
      "voice": "id_gadis",
      "chars": 43,
      "mime": "audio/mpeg"
    },
    {
      "key": "470c84a86491a5b7336b4eac8807939b3319e253cd0b7e3218221b6834464756",
      "text": "Selamat malam, Pendengar. Inilah kabar terkini dari Sorong dan sekitarnya.",
      "voice": "id_gadis",
      "chars": 74,
      "mime": "audio/mpeg"
    },
    {
      "key": "4b0148ac63820144d3fc7347ede0a7999ec55a7cabcd904f7ad45482fb09c2cc",
      "text": "liputan",
      "voice": "id_gadis",
      "chars": 7,
      "mime": "audio/mpeg"
    },
    {
      "key": "4d5aa920edb0aa391a8b043cf346774eba51b46169ea3cbc5e4303d4e09329b1",
      "text": "kongres",
      "voice": "id_gadis",
      "chars": 7,
      "mime": "audio/mpeg"
    },
    {
      "key": "4e4328f948e15dd80d8aca0bbbb341db8e771e50124ae0774ec1c69629fdd899",
      "text": "mengharumkan",
      "voice": "id_gadis",
      "chars": 12,
      "mime": "audio/mpeg"
    },
    {
      "key": "5526d7bbd57228cd6f683fdf7b0efc519e9b0cbbfc6afdfe6d110f9bfbbcc3ca",
      "text": "Prestasi terbesarnya bukan penghargaan, melainkan lapangan kerja bagi warga.",
      "voice": "id_gadis",
      "chars": 76,
      "mime": "audio/mpeg"
    },
    {
      "key": "56ace21ffb30b428ae9d0f34a703d8c1d6fe10c7585aa7befe21457c0bfd1770",
      "text": "Tepat. Itu liputan yang rapi.",
      "voice": "id_gadis",
      "chars": 29,
      "mime": "audio/mpeg"
    },
    {
      "key": "5d09bad61ea901a5aa12fcacba398bfad9813548fb08010bab7a4d2008362761",
      "text": "Saya ingin menginspirasi anak muda Papua untuk berani mulai.",
      "voice": "id_gadis",
      "chars": 60,
      "mime": "audio/mpeg"
    },
    {
      "key": "5d6a7566c281772dfdcc532b5719be1406477607f064e450a13d396044ac9438",
      "text": "Mau sekali. Judulnya \"Pelajar Sorong meraih medali emas\"?",
      "voice": "id_ardi",
      "chars": 57,
      "mime": "audio/mpeg"
    },
    {
      "key": "5e9b74f1486c9077e1157d14f10d54c1c079ce6a9bc94945c107a8ef0f3e0ead",
      "text": "inovasi",
      "voice": "id_gadis",
      "chars": 7,
      "mime": "audio/mpeg"
    },
    {
      "key": "6221d62be9abc3b37d8148ad6dc2edd8a863a2180a7c055ebf0a8847dc3bfed6",
      "text": "Pelajar itu meraih medali emas dan dilaporkan akan mendapat beasiswa.",
      "voice": "id_gadis",
      "chars": 69,
      "mime": "audio/mpeg"
    },
    {
      "key": "64f5a408d34445cb403ecdc56c8275caec5d34cd806f6e07ba05a0faba184332",
      "text": "Selamat malam, Pendengar. Sekian siaran berita dari Sorong.",
      "voice": "id_gadis",
      "chars": 59,
      "mime": "audio/mpeg"
    },
    {
      "key": "6544893a02e1cd53da3531170c21cf57d663cf4f44c9f51fd47da5561fe27ba7",
      "text": "Kemenangan dalam lomba itu mengharumkan nama sekolah mereka.",
      "voice": "id_gadis",
      "chars": 60,
      "mime": "audio/mpeg"
    },
    {
      "key": "68d66eaf65b3a5141b628cc83dde513b3129fb00abcb242aa6dd5ead2bab327f",
      "text": "dilaporkan",
      "voice": "id_gadis",
      "chars": 10,
      "mime": "audio/mpeg"
    },
    {
      "key": "6e55159a2652debe982eb3e585542405bc9d93021c9005b38d2133ff8b4d89f2",
      "text": "Wirausaha muda itu menerima penghargaan karena inovasinya yang menginspirasi.",
      "voice": "id_gadis",
      "chars": 77,
      "mime": "audio/mpeg"
    },
    {
      "key": "6f2c01d7ef215974777ca5600e415de5c6ae5ca50a3471b35a90cb3c2c6d47bd",
      "text": "Mereka bersaing dengan dua puluh negara di kancah internasional.",
      "voice": "id_gadis",
      "chars": 64,
      "mime": "audio/mpeg"
    },
    {
      "key": "6fc93aa16dddbb0db4351ca9e9ea45a3f54a3b3967159c46db3fafc891ae9a35",
      "text": "menginspirasi",
      "voice": "id_gadis",
      "chars": 13,
      "mime": "audio/mpeg"
    },
    {
      "key": "715f8e158b70e46611e650f2551295b3625805758b31413cc1b71505d8d56cb6",
      "text": "lomba",
      "voice": "id_gadis",
      "chars": 5,
      "mime": "audio/mpeg"
    },
    {
      "key": "86d8543beca0810fa54436f04aeb703d0de7ffdd88ced4533b6fa0bea6f56dc6",
      "text": "siaran",
      "voice": "id_gadis",
      "chars": 6,
      "mime": "audio/mpeg"
    },
    {
      "key": "9282e164a1fb895213264b5f9bdf6d3320561aa9c3c38eaeb5cc3dab8fee4a5f",
      "text": "penghargaan",
      "voice": "id_gadis",
      "chars": 11,
      "mime": "audio/mpeg"
    },
    {
      "key": "950c67cff88af293098b931a845387557496b6305e2be9a33f6ad33dfa14b6fc",
      "text": "Bagaimana rasanya menerima penghargaan nasional?",
      "voice": "id_ardi",
      "chars": 48,
      "mime": "audio/mpeg"
    },
    {
      "key": "9555d049889e8c72d7b1f42aa78a57a8217704b34b9920d0b80ddc68f61aee06",
      "text": "Pantai kami penuh plastik. Saya pikir, sampah ini bisa jadi bahan bangunan.",
      "voice": "id_gadis",
      "chars": 75,
      "mime": "audio/mpeg"
    },
    {
      "key": "9884e3a19d0b99170e02f330024e691c8d8e467929cda6c511c44aee74fe2ae3",
      "text": "\"Medali ini untuk Papua,\" ujarnya sambil tersenyum.",
      "voice": "id_gadis",
      "chars": 51,
      "mime": "audio/mpeg"
    },
    {
      "key": "a4bd39cf2f1da1ba4c683968b31fdd8b8e9850422fed89de224cf56ea823cf2a",
      "text": "Kabar terkini dari reporter kami, kapal cepat ke Waisai sudah berangkat.",
      "voice": "id_gadis",
      "chars": 72,
      "mime": "audio/mpeg"
    },
    {
      "key": "aedc42d321b362538e25f274d006a73d9e7784a033e39454377e242bad253e82",
      "text": "Lampu merah sudah menyala. Kamu siap membaca siaran?",
      "voice": "id_gadis",
      "chars": 52,
      "mime": "audio/mpeg"
    },
    {
      "key": "b41672d330d8aa36463e279d94c62a9acc6681b7707e0b8d3d90f080ac7334da",
      "text": "Terbalik, Mohamed. Pendengar mau tahu dulu siapa menang lomba apa, di mana, kapan.",
      "voice": "id_gadis",
      "chars": 82,
      "mime": "audio/mpeg"
    },
    {
      "key": "b850fa9dda4a57d1707252312de7c0047e5fe1039a748c3e177cea3cb40f0b8d",
      "text": "Selamat datang di Sorong, Mohamed! Saya wartawan di radio lokal. Mau bantu menulis berita?",
      "voice": "id_gadis",
      "chars": 90,
      "mime": "audio/mpeg"
    },
    {
      "key": "bdd248e998d350719ed490c156417ee9a15ce324bbee43dfd7e712db1361e914",
      "text": "Baik. Lalu saya serahkan ke reporter di pelabuhan, ya?",
      "voice": "id_ardi",
      "chars": 54,
      "mime": "audio/mpeg"
    },
    {
      "key": "beda8a7fc94a06d43579f8cf115aa1e8bdd954bf5b4f8ee5fb16a16548c8b3df",
      "text": "sumpah",
      "voice": "id_gadis",
      "chars": 6,
      "mime": "audio/mpeg"
    },
    {
      "key": "c54f2707e912d182e8953819748aba17a936a568ff5d163add0fdbb2ddcade8b",
      "text": "Reporter kami melaporkan langsung dari pelabuhan.",
      "voice": "id_gadis",
      "chars": 49,
      "mime": "audio/mpeg"
    },
    {
      "key": "cc5466cc03d3b57e1cf43cbcc14672f1b300b38b5102e8ba3d27f0e7918a0c10",
      "text": "Apakah sumpah itu berarti semua orang harus berhenti memakai bahasa daerah?",
      "voice": "id_ardi",
      "chars": 75,
      "mime": "audio/mpeg"
    },
    {
      "key": "d14a5e1dc5e2c122f1a8a66d00982d89366575b063c28a436e68a05612787133",
      "text": "Jadi satu tanah air, satu bangsa, dan banyak bahasa yang bersatu.",
      "voice": "id_ardi",
      "chars": 65,
      "mime": "audio/mpeg"
    },
    {
      "key": "d1a87ddb241a8089b0c838f5135f16e5b3aa9d3cec414321e8afe383c3fc14ec",
      "text": "Kita berbangsa satu dan bangga tampil di kancah internasional.",
      "voice": "id_gadis",
      "chars": 62,
      "mime": "audio/mpeg"
    },
    {
      "key": "d30d0400521d8cf0cf1760a8e62bc70a16543165983b8fdde80ca6cdaf7f768e",
      "text": "Wirausaha muda itu terkenal karena inovasinya.",
      "voice": "id_gadis",
      "chars": 46,
      "mime": "audio/mpeg"
    },
    {
      "key": "dc39e72e48ed8c3f05e6f62446d3cb881efdaf37c80c83152c62da2da324e9ac",
      "text": "Terima kasih, Kaka. Saya hampir lupa bilang \"ujarnya\" setelah kutipan.",
      "voice": "id_ardi",
      "chars": 70,
      "mime": "audio/mpeg"
    },
    {
      "key": "ddd58e8f35ed2f0c35b3d8b5847156c86e37bfb8643488dc2e7afe4679a76334",
      "text": "meraih",
      "voice": "id_gadis",
      "chars": 6,
      "mime": "audio/mpeg"
    },
    {
      "key": "e54f3e43712fcb4e02f32150429fe71b893d36b07652f1c58a05e897bc50ffd8",
      "text": "Kita berbangsa satu, tetapi berbahasa daerah yang berbeda-beda.",
      "voice": "id_gadis",
      "chars": 63,
      "mime": "audio/mpeg"
    },
    {
      "key": "e6bacf892d46835ad11bc3cdcbcfbd9f30a4a371a2dc411ba9159f2575a70b60",
      "text": "Lalu kutipannya, '\"Saya ingin anak Papua percaya diri,\" ujarnya.'",
      "voice": "id_ardi",
      "chars": 65,
      "mime": "audio/mpeg"
    },
    {
      "key": "e75a8bd736c42eac9bb777a7f33290d492bf68d561452e5ffd188210d221a0bb",
      "text": "persatuan",
      "voice": "id_gadis",
      "chars": 9,
      "mime": "audio/mpeg"
    },
    {
      "key": "e939d7d0adf576f1a87d20039f1e0b0149f88537b4ef82f0c2b48951cb3f5dd7",
      "text": "diduga",
      "voice": "id_gadis",
      "chars": 6,
      "mime": "audio/mpeg"
    },
    {
      "key": "ec40ff6b079584cdf7568aec1471947ada8ddd2cce330edb87d1c05f6eb75266",
      "text": "Tidak. Bahasa Indonesia itu bahasa persatuan. Di Papua saja ada lebih dari dua ratus lima puluh bahasa daerah.",
      "voice": "id_gadis",
      "chars": 110,
      "mime": "audio/mpeg"
    },
    {
      "key": "ec807dc3d36390a257d7a09218180a5dc0a7a49f5e0d8cd0a155de72bc46c88f",
      "text": "Dua hari lagi tanggal 28 Oktober, Hari Sumpah Pemuda. Radio kami akan siaran khusus.",
      "voice": "id_gadis",
      "chars": 84,
      "mime": "audio/mpeg"
    },
    {
      "key": "ee325963344ff206b731cf18c8041599f55f9872a8f571717dca10a61154ba46",
      "text": "Liputan lengkap tentang lomba itu bisa Anda dengar pukul tujuh malam.",
      "voice": "id_gadis",
      "chars": 69,
      "mime": "audio/mpeg"
    },
    {
      "key": "f2731adc2fb5979702a2ea43dee38f43a8b86b0798235ff8350761a6146d354e",
      "text": "Jadi sejarahnya di akhir. Lalu kutipan dari pelatihnya di tengah?",
      "voice": "id_ardi",
      "chars": 65,
      "mime": "audio/mpeg"
    },
    {
      "key": "f709c61e5dcbe63686a693c596ecf091fae38d51bc2f9d62c13c18cb265e999a",
